Package: revdeprunner
Type: Package
Title: Reusable Reverse-Dependency Checks
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("James", "Melville", email = "jlmelville@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Prepares reusable package binaries and compares reverse dependencies
    against released and development versions of an R package using 'revdepcheck'.
    Reports dependency preparation failures before comparison and reuses completed
    work through saved checkpoints.
